menu "OTA Manager"

    config OTA_MANAGER_ALLOW_HTTP
        bool "Allow OTA over plain HTTP (insecure transport)"
        default n
        help
            Khi TAT (mac dinh, khuyen nghi): ota_manager tu choi ngay moi lenh
            OTA co "url" khong bat dau bang "https://", truoc ca khi giao cho
            ota_task - tranh bi ha cap (downgrade) xuong ket noi khong ma hoa
            do vo tinh hoac do bi tan cong. Xac thuc chu ky firmware (Secure
            OTA Without Secure Boot) van luon chay du bat/tat option nay, nhung
            HTTP van de lo du lieu tren duong truyen (nghe len, sua doi giua
            duong truoc khi den buoc verify chu ky).

            Chi BAT option nay khi dev/test cuc bo voi server HTTP (khong
            TLS). Khi bat, ban PHAI bat them:
            "Component config -> ESP HTTPS OTA -> Allow HTTP for OTA"
            (CONFIG_ESP_HTTPS_OTA_ALLOW_HTTP) - day la option cua chinh thu
            vien esp_https_ota, thieu no thi esp_https_ota_begin() se tu choi
            URL http:// du ota_manager co cho phep hay khong.

endmenu
